Z||000005||Carrolles||08-02-2000||09:02 AM||||Theoger I have a question for you.<P>I have an after market cruise control (JC Whitney VSS unit) that I am going to install on my 85SE v-6 4spd.  I have to set a jumper on the control unit to select the pulses per mile.  Last year you told me that the Fiero uses 4000 ppm and converts it to 2000 ppm at some point.  Do you know what wire I should connect to at the ECM to get either of these signals.  I'm confused as to where the 4000 to 2000 conversion takes place.<P>Thanks,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
